{"id":"christchurch","name":"克赖斯特彻奇","en":"Christchurch","country":"New Zealand","lat":-43.535,"lng":172.63,"dek":"雅芳河穿过哥特式废墟，花园仍在生长","history":"基督城一带最早的定居痕迹出现在红峭壁的山洞中，考古学家在此发现了猎食恐鸟的原住民部落遗存。毛利口述历史将这一地区的居住史推到公元1000年前后，十六世纪起，来自北岛东岸的怀塔哈人移居此地，之后又有纳蒂马莫和纳塔胡等部落在此生活。城市如今所在的雅芳河沿岸，毛利语地名为Ōtautahi，得名于一位曾在此定居的酋长。","culture":"基督城的文化气质里有一种重建中的秩序感。2010年和2011年的两次地震摧毁了市中心的大量砖石建筑，但艺术与展览活动并未因此中断。基督城美术馆在关闭多年后重新开放，当代艺术空间CoCA也持续展出新西兰本地艺术家的作品。由日本建筑师坂茂设计的纸板大教堂以纸管结构承担起临时主教堂的职能，教堂内部光线明亮，材料轻盈，与仍在修复中的石质老座堂形成对照。","pull":"花园之城，废墟之上继续开花","sights":[{"name":"纸板大教堂","orig":"Cardboard Cathedral","intro":"由日本建筑师坂茂设计，2013年启用，作为地震后圣公会座堂受损期间的过渡教堂。建筑使用纸管作为主要结构材料，形式简洁，内部光线充足，是基督城灾后重建中最具标志性的新建筑之一。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e2/Christchurch_Cardboard_Cathedral_1_%2831310889165%29.jpg/960px-Christchurch_Cardboard_Cathedral_1_%2831310889165%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":668},"src":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cardboard_Cathedral"},{"name":"圣米迦勒与诸天使教堂","orig":"St Michael and All Angels Church","intro":"建于1872年的木结构圣公会教堂，地震中仅轻微受损。它保留了早期坎特伯雷殖民时期的木作工艺，室外有独立钟塔，与市中心常见的新建筑形成不同节奏。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/bb/Church_of_St_Michael_and_All_Angels%2C_Christchurch%2C_New_Zealand.jpg/960px-Church_of_St_Michael_and_All_Angels%2C_Christchurch%2C_New_Zealand.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":430},"src":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Church_of_St_Michael_and_All_Angels%2C_Christchurch"},{"name":"坎特伯雷博物馆","orig":"Canterbury Museum","intro":"位于罗尔斯顿大道，与植物园相邻。馆藏涵盖毛利文化、殖民史、自然史和南极探险展区。目前因翻修关闭至2029年前后，部分展品暂移至格洛斯特街的CoCA空间展出。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0e/Canterbury_Museum_01.jpg/960px-Canterbury_Museum_01.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":695},"src":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Canterbury_Museum%2C_Christchurch"},{"name":"国际南极中心","orig":"International Antarctic Centre","intro":"位于基督城国际机场旁，是新西兰、意大利与美国南极计划的后勤基地之一。中心设低温体验室和企鹅救助区，可近距离感受南极大陆的边缘生活。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/3c/International_Antarctic_Centre.jpg/960px-International_Antarctic_Centre.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":720},"src":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/International_Antarctic_Centre"}],"foods":[{"name":"新西兰葡萄酒","orig":"New Zealand wine","intro":"基督城附近及南岛产区出产的黑皮诺和长相思酸度清晰，果味收敛。可在市内餐厅、酒吧或专门酒铺按杯品尝。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a7/New_Zealand_wines_-_a_selection.jpg/960px-New_Zealand_wines_-_a_selection.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":608},"src":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E7%B4%90%E8%A5%BF%E8%98%AD%E8%91%A1%E8%90%84%E9%85%92"},{"name":"帕芙洛娃","orig":"Pavlova","intro":"新西兰常见甜点，以烤蛋白霜为底，外层酥、内里软，顶部配奶油和水果。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/67/Pavlova_dessert.JPG/960px-Pavlova_dessert.JPG?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":715},"src":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pavlova"},{"name":"麦卢卡蜂蜜","orig":"Mānuka honey","intro":"产自新西兰和澳大利亚的麦卢卡树花蜜，带有深色草本气息。可在当地食品店购买。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/33/Manuka_honey_in_a_bowl.jpg/960px-Manuka_honey_in_a_bowl.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":640},"src":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/M%C4%81nuka_honey"},{"name":"鱼和薯条","orig":"Fish and chips","intro":"基督城最常见的廉价外食，路边小店现炸供应。鲨鱼、鳕鱼等鱼类裹面糊油炸后搭配粗薯条。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/ff/Fish_and_chips_blackpool.jpg/960px-Fish_and_chips_blackpool.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":636},"src":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E7%82%B8%E9%B1%BC%E8%96%AF%E6%9D%A1"}],"hero":[{"u":"https:/